@page "/not-found"
@layout MainLayout
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@* The fallback policy demands a signed-in user, and this page is where an unauthenticated
   request lands when anything throws. Without this it demands a login, the login fails
   for whatever reason brought us here, and the two redirect at each other forever with
   the return URL re-encoding each lap — an error page that hides the error. *@
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Not found — Gatherum</PageTitle>

<h1>Not found</h1>
<p>Sorry, the content you are looking for does not exist.</p>